  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the implementation of the Global Soil Partnership of FAO  - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective functioning of the Intergovernmental Technical Panel on Soils as an international mechanism providing scientific advice to the GSP and other panels in which soils play a role.
GSP Plans of Action partially implemented via the Regional Implementation Plans with focus on soil governance at global, regional and national levels.
Advocacy and awareness raising activities on the importance of healthy soils implemented, in line with and following up on various ongoing or upcoming processes, such as the Post 2015, the IYS 2015, the new World Soil Charter  and others.</narrative>
  </description>
